  unitName: Power Imp Pakpak
  unitId: 10452
  unitNumber: 551
  description: These creatures are said to have come about as workers around the
    time of creation. They share a hive mind, with no single specimen possessing
    much of an ego. That and the fact that they can dissolve into raw power means
    they can fuse quite well into other creatures, permanently boosting their Atk
    power. Do not leave them unattended for too long, as they are known to dissolve
    those around them when left to their own devices.
  summonDesc: We are one!<br>Me, myself, and I, and you...<br>Wait... what was I
    just saying?
